    "2台とも「%@」を選んでいます。片方の端末では「%@」を選んでください" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both devices chose “%1$@”. Choose “%2$@” on one of them"
